                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe4e4647-1f70-396b-8834-1a4274a0b48d",
                        "entry_id": "36ad9105-1f93-39cc-a661-12bf69ed0e5e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het orgaansysteem dat bij dieren een coördinerende rol speelt bij alle handelingen, zoals het aansturen van de spieren, het verwerken van zintuiglijke prikkels en bij hogere diersoorten de emotionele en cognitieve processen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d8e97da-cb05-4255-b8fe-47e07186255e",
                        "source_entry_id": "36ad9105-1f93-39cc-a661-12bf69ed0e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "fe4e4647-1f70-396b-8834-1a4274a0b48d",
                        "source_sense_description": "het gehele zenuwsysteem",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nervensystem",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nervensystem",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f0dca36-b18e-3b30-8905-3222e08a8f38",
                                        "entry_id": "d48b0c50-5015-3f31-8215-6d89da2ac74e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Gesamtheit aller Nerven- und Gliazellen in einem Organismus"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7bf2f17-a519-4fb2-b94b-761482a1b10b",
                                                "sense_id": "6f0dca36-b18e-3b30-8905-3222e08a8f38",
                                                "text": "„Das Herz bereitet sich auf eine erhöhte Leistung vor. Das Nervensystem gerät in einen Zustand der Anspannung. \"Eine innere motorische Unruhe\", erklärt der deutsche Arzt und Spezialist für Lärmwirkungen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7beb9f19-5132-4605-9ed4-5879b0c4548a",
                                                "sense_id": "6f0dca36-b18e-3b30-8905-3222e08a8f38",
                                                "text": "„Der Energieaufwand lohnt sich, denn durch die erhöhte Temperatur in den Muskeln und im Nervensystem können die Räuber schneller reagieren und sind gegenüber Beutefischen klar im Vorteil.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f01676a-46c9-4c18-8aad-8d3262794a20",
                                                "sense_id": "6f0dca36-b18e-3b30-8905-3222e08a8f38",
                                                "text": "„Allgemeine Schwäche des Körpers und erhöhte Reizbarkeit des Nervensystems gesellen sich dazu.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "340c143a-e1b7-488e-83d5-17e03a519787",
                                                "sense_id": "6f0dca36-b18e-3b30-8905-3222e08a8f38",
                                                "text": "„Ich bin sehr geruchsempfindlich, und der intensive Kohlgeruch hatte mein vegetatives Nervensystem mobilisiert.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a65e4d3-f1ed-4f3f-bd2b-b02a9ae60e51",
                        "source_entry_id": "36ad9105-1f93-39cc-a661-12bf69ed0e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "fe4e4647-1f70-396b-8834-1a4274a0b48d",
                        "source_sense_description": "het gehele zenuwsysteem",
                        "target_lang_word": "nervous system",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nervous system",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "317b5971-f366-38e5-bb1a-28a78757d23e",
                                        "entry_id": "89652ef0-a3e1-353a-88cd-1d2389c063f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An organ system whose principal constituent is nervous tissue that coordinates the activities of muscles, monitors organs, constructs and processes data received from the senses, and initiates actions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c92c27d-60fc-4ed7-8a9a-c242875bef8c",
                                                "sense_id": "317b5971-f366-38e5-bb1a-28a78757d23e",
                                                "text": "Sudden anger rose in him. “What I’m looking for,” he barked, “is to be left in peace.” His voice trembled with a rage far bigger than her intrusion merited, the rage which shocked him whenever it coursed through his nervous system, like a flood."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a260f3d4-ddb2-490b-a122-c513bcb1c576",
                                                "sense_id": "317b5971-f366-38e5-bb1a-28a78757d23e",
                                                "text": "Biotics manipulate mass effect fields using dozens of element zero nodules within their nervous system that react to electric stimuli from the brain. Amplifiers allow biotics to synchronize the nodules so they can form fields large and strong enough for practical use."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c37072be-790d-4e86-be49-6de5aa4d5a16",
                        "source_entry_id": "36ad9105-1f93-39cc-a661-12bf69ed0e5e",
                        "source_sense_id": "fe4e4647-1f70-396b-8834-1a4274a0b48d",
